        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions LGN150FS4, 1-1/2\" Diameter Offset Wooden Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Lewis Offset Pull with Stainless Steel Brackets is available with brushed stainless steel, polished stainless steel, or powder coated brackets in matte black. Choose <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-tcmbw.pdf?v=1704262320\" target=\"new\">the type of wood</a> for the handle from cherry, mahogany, white oak, black walnut, and teak. The Lewis Offset Wood Door Pull with Stainless Steel Brackets is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. This door handle can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to back mounted. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon't see the right Wood Finish Color?  Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> and we can make it for you!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Lewis Wood Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Wood</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-tcmbw.pdf?v=1704262320\"><b>First Impressions Wood Color Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-LWS02-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262328\"><b>First Impressions LGN150FS4 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LGN150018FS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Offset: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LGN150024FS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Offset: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LGN150036FS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Offset: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This wood door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Lewis Offset Pull with Stainless Steel Brackets",
                "description": "The Lewis Offset Pull with Stainless Steel Brackets is available with brushed stainless steel, polished stainless steel, or powder coated brackets in matte black. Choose the type of wood for the handle from cherry, bubinga, jatoba, mahogany, white oak, black walnut, and teak. The Lewis Offset Wood Door Pull with Stainless Steel Brackets is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. This door handle can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to back mounted.",
                "keywords": "FII-LWS02, Lewis Wood Pull with Stainless Steel Brackets, Lewis Offset Pull with Stainless Steel Brackets, Lewis Offset Wood Door Pull with Stainless Steel Brackets, First Impressions LWS02, 18 inch door pulls, 24 inch door pulls, 36 inch door pulls, modern wood door pulls, modern wooden door pulls, wooden door handles, First Impressions Lewis 02 Wood Door Handles, 1-1/2 inch Diameter Offset Wooden Door Pulls, FII-LGN150FS4, First Impressions LGN150FS4, First impressions  \r\nLAGUNA 150 door pulls,"
